WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:04.499
One animation, many places it can go. Open Export.

2
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:13.046
Lottie JSON, or the smaller dotLottie, for apps that already play Lottie.

3
00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:18.520
A video, for presentations and social posts.

4
00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:21.149
A GIF, for email and chat.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.265
Or a still image, for a store page or a thumbnail.

6
00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:30.521
The same document behind all of them: change it once, export again.
